      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Enable or disable an additional resim cache based on IResimCacheBase (FEvolutionResimCache by default) that also caches particle collision constraints\nthis is disabled by default since cached collisions will be wrong during a resimulation for particles that are desynced\nand particles that are in sync doesn't need collision data since we just step through their states in history.\""
