        {
          "name": "In Async Block Mode",
          "type": "EAsyncBlockMode"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Set the Async Block Mode, valid mode can be 0, 1, or 2\n0 blocks on any physics steps generated from past GT Frames, and blocks on none of the tasks from current frame.\n1 blocks on everything except the single most recent task (including tasks from current frame)\n1 should guarantee we will always have a future output for interpolation from 2 frames in the past\n2 doesn't block the game thread. Physics steps could be eventually be dropped if taking too much time."
    },
